#: resources/animate.glade:440
msgid ""
"<b>Color and segment scale</b> <i>— currents, charges, and fields shade the "
"model</i>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Farge og segmentskala</b> <i>— strømmer, ladninger og felt fargelegger "
"modellen</i>"

#: resources/animate.glade:481
msgid "None (geometry)"
msgstr "Ingen (geometri)"

#: resources/animate.glade:485
msgid "Show the bare structure geometry with no quantity coloring."
msgstr "Vis strukturgeometrien uten fargelegging etter størrelse."

#: resources/animate.glade:498 resources/xnec2c.glade:11223
msgid "Currents"
msgstr "Strømmer"

#: resources/animate.glade:502
msgid "Animate current magnitude and direction along the wires."
msgstr "Animer strømmens størrelse og retning langs trådene."

#: resources/animate.glade:515 resources/xnec2c.glade:11238
msgid "Charges"
msgstr "Ladninger"

#: resources/animate.glade:519
msgid "Animate charge magnitude along the wires."
msgstr "Animer ladningens størrelse langs trådene."

#: resources/animate.glade:542
msgid "_Polarization:"
msgstr "_Polarisering:"

#: resources/animate.glade:557
msgid ""
"Select the polarization component used by radiation-pattern gain and far-"
"zone animation vectors.\n"
"\n"
"Mirrors the polarization selection in the main, radiation-pattern, and "
"frequency-plot windows.\n"
"\n"
"Hovering an entry previews it live."
msgstr ""
"Velg polariseringskomponenten som brukes av forsterkning i "
"strålingsdiagrammet og animasjonsvektorer for fjernfelt.\n"
"\n"
"Speiler polariseringsvalget i hoved-, strålingsdiagram- og frekvensplott-"
"vinduene.\n"
"\n"
"Å holde pekeren over en oppføring forhåndsviser den direkte."

#: resources/animate.glade:630
msgid "Display"
msgstr "Visning"

#: resources/animate.glade:668
msgid "Flow direction:"
msgstr "Strømretning:"

#: resources/animate.glade:747
msgid "Patches"
msgstr "Patcher"

#: resources/animate.glade:782
msgid "Near E field"
msgstr "Nær E-felt"

#: resources/animate.glade:797
msgid "Near H field"
msgstr "Nær H-felt"

#: resources/animate.glade:812
msgid "Poynting vector"
msgstr "Poynting-vektor"

#: resources/animate.glade:851
msgid "Near Field"
msgstr "Nærfelt"

#: resources/animate.glade:886
msgid "Far E field"
msgstr "E-fjernfelt"

#: resources/animate.glade:890
msgid ""
"Draw the far-zone electric field as arrows tangent to the gain surface while "
"animating.\n"
"\n"
"Enable by opening the radiation pattern window."
msgstr ""
"Tegn det elektriske fjernfeltet som piler tangentielt til "
"forsterkningsflaten under animasjon.\n"
"\n"
"Aktiveres ved å åpne strålingsdiagramvinduet."

#: resources/animate.glade:903
msgid "Far H field"
msgstr "H-fjernfelt"

#: resources/animate.glade:907
msgid ""
"Draw the far-zone magnetic field instead, a quarter turn from the electric "
"field in the tangent plane and in step with it in time.\n"
"\n"
"Enable by opening the radiation pattern window."
msgstr ""
"Tegn i stedet det magnetiske fjernfeltet, en kvart omdreining fra det "
"elektriske feltet i tangentplanet og i takt med det i tid.\n"
"\n"
"Aktiveres ved å åpne strålingsdiagramvinduet."

#: resources/animate.glade:920
msgid "World reference"
msgstr "Verdensreferanse"

#: resources/animate.glade:936
msgid "Ludwig-3 reference"
msgstr "Ludwig-3-referanse"

#: resources/animate.glade:961
msgid "Arrow:"
msgstr "Pil:"

#: resources/animate.glade:978
msgid ""
"Longest arrow a cell draws, as a fraction of that cell's own pattern radius, "
"so the arrows track whichever gain scale shapes the surface."
msgstr ""
"Den lengste pilen en celle tegner, som en brøkdel av cellens egen "
"mønsterradius, slik at pilene følger uansett hvilken forsterkningsskala som "
"former flaten."

#: resources/animate.glade:1020
msgid "Far Field"
msgstr "Fjernfelt"

#: resources/animate.glade:1038
msgid ""
"Draw the far-zone field as tangent vectors on the radiation pattern gain "
"surface while this window is open."
msgstr ""
"Tegn fjernfeltet som tangentvektorer på forsterkningsflaten i "
"strålingsdiagrammet mens dette vinduet er åpent."

